<title>UK: CIBC Wood Gundy hires HSBC James Capel oil analyst.</title>
<headline>CIBC Wood Gundy hires HSBC James Capel oil analyst.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>CIBC Wood Gundy announced it hired former HSBC James Capel oil analyst Jim Joseph to develop the research and merger and acquisitions projects at its London unit Lovegrove &amp; Associates.</p>
<p>Lovegrove &amp; Associates specialises in advising comoanies on the buying and selling of upstream petroleum properties around the world with the exception of North America.</p>
<p>Joseph was a senior European oil analyst with HSBC James Capel after seven years working as a journalist.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
